#: ../userguides/oauth2_setup.rst:1 1f56ef4e983f4f6cae1b90788474f009
msgid "**1. Select the** ``Use OAuth2`` **option in the login window**"
msgstr "**1.选择**``使用 OAuth2`` **登录窗口中的选项**"

#: 1009685e6a7f439b9ee203eeac9b5c5b
msgid "OAuth login window"
msgstr "OAuth 登录窗口"

#: ../userguides/oauth2_setup.rst:11 413e68a7720d4cacbe70ea18b2c137a2
msgid "**2. Set the master password**"
msgstr "**2.设置主密码**"

#: ../userguides/oauth2_setup.rst:13 bd2e9d14f6dd4009a47d7f8fb653f8a6
msgid ""
"You will be prompted to set a new `master authentication password "
"<https://docs.qgis.org/3.28/en/docs/user_manual/auth_system/auth_overview.html#master-"
"password>`_ - qgis feature to ensure the security of sensitive information "
"storage."
msgstr ""
"系统会提示您设置新的`主认证密码<https://docs.qgis.org/3.28/en/docs/user_manual/auth_system/auth_overview.html#master-"
"password>`_ - qgis功能确保敏感信息存储的安全。"

#: ../userguides/oauth2_setup.rst:22 2699c0e9c05745e2b7834dd87767c0b3
msgid "**3. Click** ``Log in`` **button**"
msgstr "**3.单击**``登录``**按钮**"

#: ../userguides/oauth2_setup.rst:24 55ddb0bf606b46a1950f5e8ab7c6df85
msgid ""
"You will receive the following message, **restart** QGIS before the next "
"steps."
msgstr "在执行后续步骤之前，您将收到以下消息：**重新启动** QGIS。"

#: ../userguides/oauth2_setup.rst:33 293b8e688fbc47dabe88f0f8a19696f1
msgid "**4. After restarting QGIS, click** ``Log in``"
msgstr "**4.重启QGIS后，点击**``登录``"

#: ../userguides/oauth2_setup.rst:35 3b370c149b404e6a891cb51af19c1f6c
msgid ""
"You will be redirected to the browser to log in/register in the mapflow "
"system:"
msgstr "您将被重定向到浏览器以登录/注册mapflow系统："

#: ../userguides/oauth2_setup.rst:44 a1a53d56df5340aa93f18e1f7f6c57b8
msgid ""
"After successfully logging in, you will receive a message about the "
"successful verification of QGIS OAuth2:"
msgstr "登录成功后，您将收到 QGIS OAuth2 验证成功的消息："

#: ../userguides/oauth2_setup.rst:53 e0a340be97a1471ab58fd841827ac44b
msgid "You can close this page"
msgstr "您可以关闭此页面"

#: ../userguides/oauth2_setup.rst:55 803081f4fa5745ed9623040de6ae20c1
msgid "**5. Go back to QGIS**"
msgstr "**5.返回QGIS**"

#: ../userguides/oauth2_setup.rst:57 9cc97b4b6557477b94dc3ff4e2bcd927
msgid "OAuth login completed!"
msgstr "OAuth登录完成！"

#: ../userguides/oauth2_setup.rst:60 e6b2b026f4514b649e142512ffe92169
msgid ""
"If you have problems with authorization, you can delete the current "
"authentication config by going to ``Settings -> Options -> Authentication``,"
" select the config and remove it:"
msgstr "如果您遇到授权问题，可以通过转到“设置 -> 选项 -> 身份验证”来删除当前的身份验证配置，选择该配置并将其删除："
